@HighPolyDens It’s really kind of you, I really appreciate it! 🙂 I was wondering if there’s any chance we could connect. I’ve been a programmer for 5 years, working exclusively in Godot, and I already have a game on Steam. Currently, I’m working on three projects, including this submarine game, and your models have been a huge help.

To be honest, your skills are really impressive, you must have a lot of experience in 3D modeling. I’m actually looking for a 3D artist because I’m not very strong in modeling, and I feel my games could really use more polish and high-quality assets.

If you’d be open to collaborating, I’d love to work together with you! 🙂

